func encodeRLE(s) =
  {
    if (s.textLen() == 0) {
      ""
    } else {
      local res = ""
      local cur = s.segment(1, 1)
      local count = 1
      for (i: 2 .. s.textLen() step 1) {
        local ch = s.segment(i, 1)
        if (ch === cur) {
          count = count + 1
        } else {
          res = res _ count _ cur
          cur = ch
          count = 1
        }
      }
      res _ count _ cur
    }
  }

1. Define encodeRLE(s): Run-Length Encoding.
2. Track current char and count; when char changes, append count+char to result.
3. After loop, append final count+char.
4. Test "aaabbc" → "3a2b1c".

