2. Split text into words, loop with index.
3. If word not in dict, initialize empty list; append position index.

func patchDict(base, patch) =
  {
    {
      local c = copyDict(base)
      for (k, v in patch) {
        if (v === "DELETE") {
          c.delete(k)
        } else {
          c.set(k, v)
        }
      }
      c
    }
  }

1. Define patchDict(base, patch): applies changes from patch onto base.
2. Copy base into c.
3. For each patch entry: if value is "DELETE", remove key; else set it.

func maxByField(list, field) =
