  }

1. Define setJsonPath(d, pathStr, val): sets value at dot-path.
2. Splits pathStr by "." to get path list.
3. Calls setAtPath with the path list and value.

func toDotNotation(d) =
  {
    {
      local res = {  }
      local keys = flatKeys(d, "")
      for (k in keys) {
        res.set(k, d.getAtPath(k.split("."), ""))
      }
      res
    }
  }

1. Define toDotNotation(d): flattens nested dict to dot-key notation.
2. Calls flatKeys to collect all key paths (assumed helper).
